<title>UK: Jan IPE gas oil delivery 261,700 tonnes - IPE.</title>
<headline>Jan IPE gas oil delivery 261,700 tonnes - IPE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Physical delivery against the expired IPE January gas oil futures contract will be 2,617 lots, or 261,700 tonnes, an IPE official said on Friday.</p>
<p>Deliveries against the December contract were 87,900 tonnes, and against the November contract a record 865,100 tonnes. May saw the lowest delivery ever, of 12,600 tonnes.</p>
<p>-- William Maclean, ondon newsroom +44 171 542 7646</p>
